Q: Import rows from another spreadsheet (containing multiple tabs) when column contains value A: <p>the proper way would be doing it like this with REDUCE and VSTACK that will never produce ARRAY_ERROR:</p>
<pre class="lang-jsx prettyprint-override"><code>=REDUCE(TOCOL(;1); VSTACK(&quot;modulo&quot;;&quot;modulo1&quot;;&quot;modulo2&quot;;&quot;modulo3&quot;); 
 LAMBDA(x; y; IFNA(VSTACK(x; 
 QUERY(IMPORTRANGE(&quot;URL_or_ID&quot;; y&amp;&quot;!A2:O10&quot;); &quot;where Col3=1&quot;; )))))
</code></pre>

Q: Kafka metrics not exported / not updating A: <p>I believe u are missing the following binding</p>
<pre class="lang-kotlin prettyprint-override"><code>streams?.setUncaughtExceptionHandler { throwable -&gt;
            logger.error { &quot;Kafka Streams encountered an uncaught exception: ${throwable.message}&quot; }
            kafkaStreamMetrics.incrementPagelogStreamProcessorErrors()
            streams?.close(Duration.ofSeconds(30))
            StreamsUncaughtExceptionHandler.StreamThreadExceptionResponse.SHUTDOWN_CLIENT
        }

        KafkaStreamsMetrics(streams!!).bindTo(meterRegistry)

        streams?.start()
</code></pre>
